{"result":"{
  "id": "18308",
  "key": "SFCC-190",
  "summary": "PLP Inline Grid Insert – Campaign Image",
  "description": "**As a** Shopper, \n\n**I want** to see a large-format campaign image inserted within the product grid as I browse, \n\n**so that** my browsing experience feels elevated and brand storytelling is woven into the shopping journey.\n\n----\n\nThis story covers the PWA build of the campaign image variant of the inline grid insert component. The insert occupies a single large-format slot within the product grid on category pages, spanning 2 product rows in height, with regular product tiles filling the remaining columns alongside it. Multiple inserts on the same page alternate between left and right positioning.\n\nThe component can be built with mock/hardcoded content at this stage — Contentful integration is covered in SFCC-204.\n\nThis story is one of three covering the inline grid insert variants. The editorial image variant and featured product tile variant are covered in separate stories.\n\n\nReference Image (Figma is leading):\n\n![\"image-20260716-054049.png\"](image-20260716-054049.png)",
  "status": {
    "name": "In Refinement",
    "category": "To Do",
    "color": "blue-gray"
  },
  "issue_type": {
    "name": "Story"
  }
}"}

