content.content:
{"result":"{
  "id": "18385",
  "key": "SFCC-204",
  "summary": "PLP – Inline Grid Insert — Contentful",
  "description": "**As a** Site Merchandiser, \n\n**I want** the PLP inline grid insert content managed in Contentful, \n\n**so that** I can configure and update the editorial and featured content that appears within the product grid per category page without requiring a developer deployment.\n\n----\n\nThis story is a follow-up to [SFCC-190](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-190), [SFCC-273](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-273)  and [SFCC-269](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-269) which builds the PWA component shells with mock content. This story covers the Contentful content model and the integration between Contentful and the PWA Kit component so that all three insert variants are fully content-managed. A Site Merchandiser should be able to configure per category page:\n\n  - **Campaign image insert:* large format editorial/campaign image and its grid position (left or right)\n  - **Campaign image + editorial text insert:* large format editorial/campaign image, editorial title, body copy, CTA link destination, and grid position\n  - **Featured product tile insert:* product tile reference and grid position\n  - **Multiple inserts:* ability to configure more than one insert per category page, with position alternating automatically between left and right",
  "status": {
    "name": "To Do",
    "category": "To Do",
    "color": "blue-gray"
  },
  "issue_type": {
    "name": "Story"
  }
}"}

