{"result":"{
  "id": "18361",
  "key": "SFCC-195",
  "summary": "PDP – Slide Out - Details & Care",
  "description": "**As a** Shopper,\n\n**I want** to access detailed product information in an organised, expandable format on the PDP,\n\n**so that** I can find the information I need without leaving the product page.\n\n----\n\n**Image for reference (Figma is leading):**\n\n![\"image-20260730-013004.png\"](image-20260730-013004.png)\n\nAfter clicking on the CTA (e.g. “Details & Care), then this slide out selecting the relevant tab that was clicked:\n\n![\"image-20260720-065922.png\"](image-20260720-065922.png)\n\nThe PDP displays a set of tabs on the slide out, corresponding with the CTAs. Each tab expands inline to reveal its content.\n\n**Scope:**\n\nThis user story is only for the slide out component and the first Details & Care tab (other tabs covered in separate user stories linked to this).\n\nContent for all tabs except Details & Care is covered in separate user stories: SFCC-102 (Size & Fit), SFCC-267 (Shipping & Returns and Assistance), SFCC-266 (EU Environmental Qualities), [SFCC-101 PDP – Slide out - Measmerize Widget & Find My Size CTA - Jira](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-101?search_id=46c2bafd-23c4-47f5-b520-016205acf4ae) (Find My Size).",
